{"sha": "4c09fca0ab917e9ec0f50a3a35ddf30bec4ea9438e52fe752373451e6b3bab5f", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g4:fractions} 章 --- 分数初步}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g4:fractions:1}", "披萨：剩下 $\\frac56$。巧克力：吃掉 $\\frac38$。旗子：", "涂色部分占 $\\frac13$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g4:fractions:2}", "$\\frac35$ 涂了三份，$\\frac25$ 只涂了两份：", "$\\frac35$ 的涂色部分更大。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g4:fractions:3}", "$18$ 的一半：$9$。$20$ 的四分之一：$5$。$21$ 的三分之一：$7$。", "$\\frac34$ 的 $20$：三个四分之一，$3 \\times 5 = 15$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g4:fractions:4}", "$\\frac13$：走一步；$\\frac33$：落在 $1$ 上；$\\frac53$：", "从 $1$ 再走两步。落在 $2$ 上的分数是 $\\frac63$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g4:fractions:5}", "$\\frac38 < \\frac68$; \\quad $\\frac55 = 1$; \\quad $\\frac74 > 1$;", "\\quad $\\frac12 = \\frac24$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g4:fractions:6}", "$\\frac26 + \\frac36 = \\frac56$; \\quad", "$\\frac58 - \\frac28 = \\frac38$; \\quad", "$\\frac14 + \\frac24 = \\frac34$; \\quad", "$1 = \\frac33$，所以 $1 - \\frac13 = \\frac23$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g4:fractions:7}", "$\\frac54 = 1 + \\frac14$; \\quad", "$\\frac73 = 2 + \\frac13$; \\quad", "$\\frac92 = 4 + \\frac12$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g4:fractions:8}", "半小时：$30$ 分钟。四分之一小时：$15$ 分钟。四分之三小时：$45$", "分钟。三分之一小时：$20$ 分钟。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g4:fractions:9}", "$\\frac14$ 的 $24$ 是 $6$ 名戴眼镜的学生；$24 - 6 = 18$", "名没有戴眼镜。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g4:fractions:10}", "一共：$\\frac38 + \\frac48 = \\frac78$。剩下：$\\frac18$。萨姆吃得", "更多（$4$ 个八分之一，比 $3$ 个多）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g4:fractions:11}", "的确有可能：小披萨的一半，食物量", "可能比大披萨的四分之一还少。分数比较的是\\emph{同一", "整体}的部分；在比较“某物”的 $\\frac12$ 和 $\\frac14$ 之前，", "必须先确认这两个“某物”相等。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}